The JSON prompt sets in this directory are the experiment-replication and
lens-evaluation prompt sets from Anthropic's jacobian-lens repository
(https://github.com/anthropics/jacobian-lens), the companion code of
"Verbalizable Representations Form a Global Workspace in Language Models"
(2026). They are synthetic data released under the Apache License 2.0 and are
redistributed here unmodified under that license (see the repository's LICENSE
for the full text). The Go code in this repository that consumes them remains
under GoAI's own MPL-2.0 license; the .pt lens-artifact format compatibility
implemented in nlp/jlens.go follows the same repository's published format.
